# The commit TUI with the related-files panel. Run: vhs assets/tapes/tui.tape
Source assets/tapes/theme.tape
Output assets/tui.gif
Set Width 1500
Set Height 760

Hide
Type "source assets/tapes/setup.sh" Enter
Sleep 4s
Show

Type "nib" Enter
Sleep 2s
Space
Sleep 1.5s
Tab
Type "f"
Sleep 500ms
Type "show related files in the TUI"
Sleep 1s
Sleep 2s
